# Fresh profile. Shared inspection is optional and read-only.
settle 30
key escape
open mere://diagnostic-inspection
settle 10
act Open Gloss pane
settle 10
assert pane gloss
assert text Downloads
act Gloss: add section — Diagnostics
settle 5
act Gloss: move section up — Diagnostics
settle 5
assert text Diagnostics
assert text Retained:
assert text Loss evicted:
assert text Coverage: producer-supplied observations
assert a11y label: Retained:
assert a11y label: Loss evicted:
capture 01_diagnostic_inspection
act Save session
settle 10
log Shared diagnostic inspection configured and saved
